5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m here to make sure we don’t just shuffle the mess to someone else’s doorstep. Who’s feeling the heat right now?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The August heat makes the current spot unbearable. I need to know what living beside these options actually feels like, day after day.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the money. We haven’t added up the setup costs or what this corner already costs us yearly. Who’s tracking the budget?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m mostly worried about us staying on speaking terms. Whatever we pick, we still have to live here together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I have watched arrangements crumble because we never measured the true cost in hours. I want to know what this will demand of our time.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
